  "ID": "46340",
  "post_title": "La Morería de Onda intensifica los festejos taurinos en martes y miércoles víspera festiva",
  "post_date": "2014-05-01 08:25:43",
  "post_name": "la-moreria-de-onda-intensifica-los-festejos-taurinos-en-martes-y-miercoles-vispera-festiva",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Los festejos taurinos han sido este martes y mi&eacute;rcoles protagonistas casi exclusivos en el barrio de la Morer&iacute;a en Onda, con gran afluencia de p&uacute;blico en la v&iacute;spera de este jueves festivo.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_1210.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">El martes se solt&oacute; el toro del barrio, que se embol&oacute; junto a otro ejemplar de la ganader&iacute;a El Mijares. El mi&eacute;rcoles ha sido el turno de la vaca de las muchas mujeres y de la pe&ntilde;a &#39;Els divins de Sant Vicent&#39;.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdimartsdimecresmoreria14/img_7690.jpg\" alt=\"img_7690\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdimartsdimecresmoreria14/img_7691.jpg\" alt=\"img_7691\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdimartsdimecresmoreria14/img_7692.jpg\" alt=\"img_7692\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdimartsdimecresmoreria14/img_7693.jpg\" alt=\"img_7693\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdimartsdimecresmoreria14/img_7694.jpg\" alt=\"img_7694\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdimartsdimecresmoreria14/img_7695.jpg\" alt=\"img_7695\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bousdimartsdimecre